
form line
  head t

  task get
    take self
    take index, like u64

  task set
    take self, flex true
    take index, like u64
    take item, like t

  task get-size
    take self
    like u64

  task map
    head s
    take self
    like line

  task filter
    take self
    like list

  task sort
    take self, flex true

  task clone
    take self
    like line

  task slice
    take self
    take start, like u64
    take end, like u64
    like line
